{"id":87,"date":"2026-07-09T14:25:53","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T14:25:53","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/localhost:8181\/older-home-modern-comfort-heating-care-for-lancaster-rowhouses\/"},"modified":"2026-07-14T19:43:53","modified_gmt":"2026-07-14T19:43:53","slug":"older-home-modern-comfort-heating-care-for-lancaster-rowhouses","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/older-home-modern-comfort-heating-care-for-lancaster-rowhouses\/","title":{"rendered":"That Lancaster Brick Holds Heat \u2014 Except on the Third Floor"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--cream s-hero-text s-band--spacious has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center s-lead has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Brick that has held heat since McKinley was president deserves better than a space heater on the third floor and a window unit sweating onto the sill.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">Brick that deserves better<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Request a Quote<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#content\">Our Services<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"s-trust-bar\"><div class=\"s-trust__item\">15+ Years Serving PA<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Licensed &amp; Insured<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Same-Day Emergency<\/div><div class=\"s-trust__item\">Local to Your Area<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">What we handle in Lancaster<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-cards-3 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Radiator maintenance<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bleeding, balancing, and boiler tuning. Cast-iron systems outlive furnaces when maintained right.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cooling without demolition<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ductless heads or high-velocity tubing. No plaster-busting. Two paths for old walls.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Basement assessment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Humidity control and dehumidification. Limestone foundations need a moisture plan, not guessing.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-diagnostic has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b267b866 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:3rem;padding-right:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;padding-left:3rem\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Signs your Lancaster system needs attention<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Radiators warm at the bottom but cold at the top \u2014 air trapped in the system needs bleeding<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Third floor stays 8+ degrees warmer than first in summer \u2014 attic radiant heat gain unaddressed<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Boiler cycles on and off every few minutes \u2014 oversized for the actual load<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Basement humidity above 60% by June \u2014 foundation moisture migrating into ductwork<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Energy bill climbed 20%+ with no rate change \u2014 equipment efficiency degrading<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:50% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/7823574634_1bc85772d4_b.jpg\" alt=\"cast iron radiator\" class=\"wp-image-181\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/7823574634_1bc85772d4_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/7823574634_1bc85772d4_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/7823574634_1bc85772d4_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;Cast Iron Radiator Refurbishment&quot; by gavindjharper, BY-ND, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Radiators and boilers: maintain what works<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A cast-iron radiator system in decent repair will outlive every forced-air furnace on the market, and it delivers steady, silent, dust-free heat that duct systems struggle to match. The mistake owners make is treating radiator quirks as death sentences. Cold sections, banging pipes, and short-cycling boilers are almost always maintenance findings, not replacements.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our service sequence runs: pressure and expansion-tank check, circulator inspection, venting at every radiator from top floor down, and combustion analysis on the boiler itself. Sometimes that recommendation is a new condensing unit \u2014 modern models genuinely earn efficiency ratings when matched to radiator water temperatures correctly. More often it&#039;s a few hundred dollars of valves, vents, and balancing that restores full output.<\/p>\n\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list s-pills s-pills--outline\">\n<li>Radiator systems last 50+ years with valve maintenance<\/li>\n\n\n<li>DIY bleed: open top valve until water flows \u2014 adds 30-50% output<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Ductless heads need only 3-inch wall penetration<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Basement humidity above 60% degrades ductwork in 8 years<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Heat pump payback: 6-8 years in masonry rowhouses<\/li>\n\n\n<li>Dehumidifier installed: $1,800\u2013$2,500<\/li>\n\n<\/ul>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text has-media-on-the-right\" style=\"grid-template-columns:auto 50%\"><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cooling without wrecking plaster<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The reason half of Lancaster&#039;s old blocks still cool with window units is that nobody wants contractors cutting duct chases through horsehair plaster and chestnut framing. Fair enough \u2014 we don&#039;t either. Two approaches avoid it. Ductless heads mounted high on exterior walls need only a three-inch line-set penetration, routing down the rear facade or through a closet; a three-bedroom rowhouse typically needs two to three heads.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">High-velocity systems take the other path: flexible two-inch supply tubing snaked through existing cavities and closet corners, feeding unobtrusive round outlets. High-velocity costs more and does more \u2014 real central air with genuine dehumidification, invisible from every room.<\/p>\n\n<\/div><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-minisplit-2.png\" alt=\"minisplit - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1766\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-minisplit-2.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-minisplit-2-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-minisplit-2-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-minisplit-2-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure><\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The basement tells the truth<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-indent has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every assessment we run in Lancaster starts below grade, because the basement is where the house&#039;s mechanical history is written. Limestone foundations breathe moisture into the air all summer \u2014 which is why the third floor feels muggy even when the AC runs \u2014 and why dehumidification belongs in any cooling plan here. Knob-and-tube remnants tell us what the electrical panel can support.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The duct trunk usually reveals two generations of patches that explain exactly why the back bedroom never gets warm. Ninety minutes down there with a manometer and a flashlight prevents every expensive surprise that phone quotes produce.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--sand has-tint-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What every Lancaster quote must include<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-feature-row is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1756\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-2-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Room-by-room load calculation<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Masonry walls change the math \u2014 brick versus frame is not the same equation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg\" alt=\"hvac technician repair\" class=\"wp-image-188\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b.jpg 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-300x225.jpg 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/51282276312_f3389b56f2_b-768x576.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--stock\" title=\"&quot;AC Service&quot; by SuperTech HVAC Services, BY-SA, via Openverse\">Stock<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Static pressure readings<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Measured at equipment and written on the quote. Ductwork secrets revealed.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1475\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-1.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dehumidification strategy<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Summer moisture plan, not just tonnage. Basement humidity control explicit.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1476\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-1024x683.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-300x200.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2-768x512.png 768w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez-technician-2.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gpt-image-1)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Penetration routing in photos<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Line-set path described in words and pictures before any drilling starts.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-card s-feature-card is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium s-feature-card__img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png\" alt=\"technician - professional HVAC service photo\" class=\"wp-image-1755\" srcset=\"http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1.png 1024w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-300x300.png 300w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-150x150.png 150w, http:\/\/127.0.0.1:8181\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/ez2-technician-1-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><span class=\"s-img-badge s-img-badge--ai\" title=\"AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)\">AI<\/span><\/figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Electrical panel spare capacity<\/h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Measured, not assumed. Heat pump demand is not a guess.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-aa34ec83 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:2rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:2rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta--inline has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-965f9c1f wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:1.5rem;padding-right:2rem;padding-bottom:1.5rem;padding-left:2rem\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If your Cabbage Hill rowhouse stays muggy no matter how low you set the thermostat, a load calculation will show exactly where the problem starts. <a href=\"\/contact\/\">Request Load Calculation<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">County farmhouses: a different calculus<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Outside the city, the math shifts: stone farmhouses with two-foot walls, additions from three different centuries, and oil tanks nearing retirement. The same measurement-first approach applies, but answers trend toward dual-fuel \u2014 a cold-climate heat pump carrying spring and fall, with the existing furnace or propane unit taking deep-winter handoff. Every farmhouse is its own project; we quote only after walking it.<\/p>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide s-stats is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-794e3cfa wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">50+<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Years \u2014 radiator system lifespan with maintenance<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">30\u201350%<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Output gain from DIY radiator bleeding<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">3&quot;<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Wall penetration for ductless line-set routing<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">8<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Years ductwork survives above 60% basement humidity<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">6\u20138<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Year payback: heat pump in masonry rowhouse<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column s-stats__item is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"s-stats__number has-x-large-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">$0.12<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"s-stats__label wp-block-paragraph\">Per kWh \u2014 Lancaster PPL rate<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-633910b2 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:4.5rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:4.5rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-element-heading has-text-align-center wp-block-heading\">Asked often in Lancaster<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-accordion s-accordion--cards has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-1583283a wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Can you get parts for a forty-year-old boiler?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Usually, yes \u2014 circulators, aquastats, and gas valves interchange more than people expect. The honest constraint isn&#039;t parts; it&#039;s heat-exchanger condition, which we assess by inspection rather than by age.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Will ductless heads look wrong in a historic interior?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">High-wall heads are visible, no way around it. Where that&#039;s a dealbreaker we quote high-velocity instead, which hides completely, or floor-mounted units that read more like radiator cabinets. There&#039;s a right answer for most rooms.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>Why is the third floor so much hotter every summer?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Heat gain collects upward, the roof radiates down, and masonry releases the day&#039;s heat all evening. A head or dedicated duct run serving the top floor directly \u2014 plus attic air-sealing \u2014 addresses the cause; a bigger central unit mostly doesn&#039;t.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n\n<details class=\"wp-block-details is-layout-flow wp-block-details-is-layout-flow\"><summary>What does a full assessment cost?<\/summary>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ninety minutes covering all three floors and the basement, with written readings and a walk-through explanation of what we find. That conversation determines whether you need a $300 service call or a $15,000 system upgrade. We price the visit fairly because the numbers that come out of it are worth real money.<\/p>\n\n<\/details>\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull s-band s-band--dark-gradient s-band--spacious has-contrast-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-08713647 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:6rem;padding-right:2.5rem;padding-bottom:6rem;padding-left:2.5rem\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group s-cta--fullbleed has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Start with ninety minutes and a flashlight<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The measurement visit covers all three floors and the basement, produces written readings, and ends with options priced against your house&#039;s actual numbers. If the right answer is three radiator vents and an afternoon of balancing, that&#039;s the quote you&#039;ll get.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-i